2. Add reference: Microsoft.Office.Interop.Excel (for Excel export)
   → NuGet: Install-Package Microsoft.Office.Interop.Excel
3. Add System.Data.SqlClient (built-in for .NET Framework;
   for .NET 6+ install NuGet: Microsoft.Data.SqlClient
   and change Imports accordingly).
4. Run SQL/InventoryDB_Script.sql against your SQL Server.
5. Update DatabaseModule.vb → ConnStr with your server name.
6. Update ServerBillRoot in each form to your network share.
 
